## Testing

- Backend: unit tests in `tests/unit/`, integration tests in `tests/integration/` (real Postgres via testcontainers; external HTTP mocked at the boundary). See Section J of the standards for the test hierarchy and rules.
- Frontend: unit tests colocated with components.
- CI: backend (lint, type check, tests, migration up/down cycle), frontend (format, tests), security scan (secrets + dependency audit).

