## Development Workflow

Follow `karpathy-knowledge-base-example/docs/development-workflow.md` exactly. This project does not have its own workflow.

Iteration folders live at `karpathy-knowledge-base-example/docs/iterations/<story-prefix><name>/` and contain (per the workflow): `grilling.md`, `plan.md`, `tdd-trace.md`, `code-review-*.md`, `summary.md`, `code-review-walkthrough.md`. Story prefixes follow `karpathy-knowledge-base-example/docs/references/01-jira-board-structure.md`. See the worked example at `karpathy-knowledge-base-example/docs/iterations/story-2.1-full-text-search/`.

